# BC250 category: experimental
# RETIRED 2026-09-12 for the normal Open WebUI task role. Quality was promising
# (including a temporary 6/6 clarified-prompt/256-token experiment), but real
# simultaneous residency with warm GPT-OSS OOM-killed the task service. Keeping
# it as the always-available task companion would violate the warm-main UX/safety
# policy on the 16 GiB unified-memory BC-250.
#
# Ollama model: exp-qwen38-4b-distill-empero-q6-k
# Source: empero-ai/Qwen3.8-4B-Distill-GGUF @ latest
# GGUF: Qwen3.8-4B-Q6_K.gguf
# License: Apache-2.0
# Role: compact native-reasoning comparison; requires current Qwen3.5/Gated-DeltaNet runtime support.
#
# Intended role:
# - Compact reasoning comparison
# - Office/technical quality vs Qwen3.5 9B and GPT-OSS
# - Successor candidate for older 4B Qwen experiments
#
# Upstream describes this as a native reasoning model. Do not force a generic
# think:false policy during evaluation.

FROM /var/lib/bc250-llm-server/gguf/experiments/exp-qwen38-4b-distill-empero-q6-k/Qwen3.8-4B-Q6_K.gguf

PARAMETER num_gpu 99
PARAMETER num_keep 256
PARAMETER num_ctx 32768
PARAMETER temperature 0.6
PARAMETER top_p 0.95
PARAMETER top_k 20

SYSTEM """You are an experimental reasoning assistant for office, technical, coding, and analytical tasks. Follow the user's requested format, distinguish facts from inference, and answer in the requested language or the language of the latest request."""
